# Error Tracking Documentation

## Objective
Track application errors and API failures properly.

## Error Handling
A global exception handler captures unhandled errors and returns structured error responses.

## Errors Tracked
- HTTP 4xx client errors
- HTTP 5xx server errors
- Runtime exceptions
- API failures by endpoint

## Validation Endpoint
Use this endpoint to generate a test error:

```bash
curl "http://localhost:8080/api/error-test?fail=true"
```

## Grafana Query Example
```promql
rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{status=~"4..|5.."}[5m])
```
